---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Disclosures - Intentional Thrive"
  description="Important disclosures about educational content, financial conversations, and insurance-related information on Intentional Thrive."
>
  <header class="page-shell page-shell--light">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="pill">Disclosures</span>
      <h1 style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">Important context for financial content.</h1>
      <p class="section-intro">Intentional Thrive is built for education, clarity, and better financial conversations.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="section-block section-block--white">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Educational content</h2>
      <p>Articles and resources on this website are for general education. They are not a substitute for personalized financial, insurance, legal, or tax advice.</p>

      <h2>Personalized recommendations</h2>
      <p>Any recommendation should be based on your actual needs, income, obligations, risk profile, health status, family situation, and long-term goals.</p>

      <h2>Insurance products</h2>
      <p>Insurance products, including VUL policies, have costs, risks, limits, and commitments. You should read policy documents carefully and ask questions before deciding.</p>

      <h2>Professional role</h2>
      <p>Venus is a Pru Life UK Unit Manager and founder of Intentional Thrive. This website reflects her educational point of view and client-centered approach.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
